{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AdaECS\/documentation\/AdaECS"]]},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"An object that affects multiple entities in every frame.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"System"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s8SendableP","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Sendable"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"System is a fundomental part of ECS paradigm.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Use systems to implement any behavior or logic that updates entities every frame,"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"such as different types of objects or characters. For example, a physics simulation system calculates and applies the affect of gravity, forces, and collisions for all entities."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A complex game or experience may consist of many systems which need to be executed in a specific order."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The dependencies property defines when the update method for each system is called each frame. Update order is defined between system types and not between individual system instances."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Like example, let’s create a movement system:"}]},{"code":["@PlainSystem","struct MovementSystem {","","    \/\/ Configure the query to world.","    \/\/ We want to recieve entities with `PlayerComponent` and `Transform`","    @FilterQuery<Ref<Transform>, With<PlayerComponent>>","    private var query","","    @Res<Input>","    private var input","","    init(world: World) {}","","    func update(context: UpdateContext) {","        self.query.forEach { transform in","            if input.isKeyPressed(.space) {","                \/\/ Add 5 points for vertical direction","                \/\/ if space button pressed","                transform.position.y += 5","            }","        }","    }","}",""],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"}]}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaECS\/documentation\/AdaECS\/System\/init(world:)"],"anchor":"Initializers","generated":true,"title":"Initializers"},{"generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties","anchor":"Instance-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaECS\/documentation\/AdaECS\/System\/queries","doc:\/\/AdaECS\/documentation\/AdaECS\/System\/systemDependencies","doc:\/\/AdaECS\/documentation\/AdaECS\/System\/systemIdentifier"]},{"generated":true,"title":"Instance Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaECS\/documentation\/AdaECS\/System\/update(context:)"],"anchor":"Instance-Methods"},{"generated":true,"title":"Type Aliases","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaECS\/documentation\/AdaECS\/System\/UpdateContext"],"anchor":"Type-Aliases"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaECS\/documentation\/AdaECS\/System\/dependencies"],"anchor":"Type-Properties","generated":true,"title":"Type Properties"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/adaecs\/system"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AdaECS\/documentation\/AdaECS\/System","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"AdaECS"}],"externalID":"s:6AdaECS6SystemP","symbolKind":"protocol","title":"System","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"System","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Protocol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"System","kind":"identifier"}]},"kind":"symbol","relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaECS\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/AdaECS\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"inheritsFrom","kind":"relationships","title":"Inherits From"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Ada